WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.710
I was out searching for Yuzu,

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.870
when I ran into Ruri, Kurosaki's little sister,

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.500
who looks just like Yuzu.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.910
But Ruri's personality suddenly changed, 
and she challenged me to a duel.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.940
Then, Serena also entered the battle.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.260
Duel me.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.420
If you beat us in a duel,

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.070
I'll do whatever you want.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.320
The Academia scientist known as 
the Doctor has brainwashed them.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:32.210
And Yuzu, too.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.260
How dare you...

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.120
How dare you hurt Yuzu?!

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.950
Calm down, Yuya.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.660
Calm down!

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.330
You aren't the only one who 
wants to make them pay.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.160
I do, too!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:12.970
Yuya...

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.030
I hate the man who stole Ruri's smile.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.390
Yeah, so do I.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.090
The enemy we need to defeat is the Doctor!

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:24.060
And then, without doubt,

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.280
Ruri,

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.320
Serena,

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:27.190
and Yuzu...

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:28.780
...will return to us!

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:30.350
And at the same time.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.640
Thank you, honor student Asuka.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:36.110
Next up...

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.170
Huh? How?

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.310
Oh, I forgot to mention...

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:46.580
I can work this system.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.900
I was just pretending to be trapped.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:55.030
It isn't fun without an audience, you see.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.690
You...

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.150
Well, time for your execution,

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.000
Sora Shiunin!

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.670
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:11.340
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.250
Their dragons call to each other,

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:18.580
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:56.980
The Dragon of Raging Fire

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.060
I activate my spell card Frightfur 
Fusion from my hand!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:11.720
I banish Frightfur Bear and two Edge 
Imp Frightfuloids in my graveyard,

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.260
to Fusion Summon!

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.490
The inanimate toy that houses the devil,

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:19.240
annihilate the fools who oppose me!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.940
Fusion Summon!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:25.340
Appear, the magical beast that's 
a combination of all toys!

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.610
Frightfur Chimera!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:35.800
I attack Ancient Gear Hydra 
with Frightfur Chimera!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.900
Frightfur Chimera's monster effect activates.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.420
The destroyed Ancient Gear Hydra

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:49.830
is Special Summoned from 
your graveyard to my field!

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:53.310
For each monster I take control 
of with this effect,

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.280
Chimera's attack points increase by 300!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.750
Your monster's mine now.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:05.480
Oh, wow! You're doing really well!

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:07.950
Not bad at all.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:12.620
I attack directly with Ancient Gear Hydra!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:26.410
Go on, attack me.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:27.870
I'll turn the tables.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.750
Be careful, Ute... She's got a plan.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.340
Yeah, I know.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:35.670
I'll have to plan one step ahead.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.890
Action Spell Single Destruction!

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:46.040
When only one monster is on your side 
of the field, I destroy that monster!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.860
Ute used an Action Card?

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.830
I destroy Parasite Queen!

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.100
Never!

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:55.030
I activate Fusion Parasite's effect!

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.700
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
I negate Queen's destruction.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:04.180
In that instant, Parasite Queen's 
attack points decrease by 300.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:09.150
She negated Queen's destruction by sending 
Fusion Parasite to the graveyard?

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.260
But this will increase the damage you do.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.350
I'll remove your other Fusion Parasite!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:16.920
Battle!

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.320
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon,

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.260
attack Parasite Queen!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.060
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.280
I activate Parasite Queen's effect!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.460
When Parasite Queen is attacked,

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.870
I can, just once, attach one of 
her equipped Fusion Parasites

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.840
to her opponent monster!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:43.580
When a Fusion Parasite is attached to a monster 
other than Parasite Queen, it decreases

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.510
that monster's attack points by 800.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.310
I wanted to get rid of Fusion Parasite, 
but it merely attached to me.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.760
Was this her real goal?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:58.500
And I activate my trap card Power Parasite!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.100
I equip one Fusion Parasite in my 
graveyard to Parasite Queen,

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:06.170
increasing its attack points by 300.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.610
I also activate Parasite Queen's effect!

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:14.710
For each Fusion Parasite on the field, 
Queen's attack points increase by 300!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.150
Not good! She'll really damage you!

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:20.890
I activate my Quick-Play Spell The 
Phantom Knights' Round Blaze!

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:24.590
I banish two Phantom Knights 
cards in my graveyard

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.340
to destroy all monsters, on both our fields,

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.660
and end the Battle Phase.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.520
It's no use!

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.200
I send Fusion Parasite to the graveyard 
to negate its destruction!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:40.370
Then, I also send Fusion Parasite to my graveyard

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.230
to negate my dragon's destruction!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.580
Using Fusion Parasite's effect...

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.860
Not bad at all.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.050
Not so fast.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.840
It isn't over yet.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.010
The Phantom Knights' Round 
Blaze's other effect.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.880
For each monster sent to the graveyard 
during this turn's Battle Phase,

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.930
I deal 800 points of damage to you.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.740
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.700
My turn!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:16.040
Continuous Spell Parasite Factory's effect.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.640
Once per each of our turns,

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:22.650
I can equip one Fusion Parasite in my deck 
to Parasite Queen, to take control of it.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.750
The addition of another Fusion 
Parasite to the field

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.820
increases its attack points by 300.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.230
And I activate my spell card Parasite 
Reborn from my hand.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:36.790
I equip the Fusion Parasites in 
Serena's and my graveyards

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.760
to Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.670
Again?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.140
Parasite Queen's effect

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:50.890
reduces the attack points of monsters 
equipped with Fusion Parasites

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.840
by 800 points for each.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.360
And having two more Fusion 
Parasites on the field

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.720
increases Parasite Queen's 
attack points by 600.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.690
Time for battle.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.320
Parasite Queen attacks Dark 
Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.460
Action Spell Evade.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:16.430
I negate Parasite Queen's attack!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:20.380
I'm not done yet.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.260
I activate my spell Parasite Maneuver.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.780
Its effect allows Parasite Queen 
to attack once more, this turn!

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:27.750
What?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.630
You cannot dodge this one.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.980
Parasite Queen attacks again!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:39.070
Action Spell Miracle.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:42.570
This prevents Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon's destruction this turn,

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.300
halving damage dealt!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:59.310
Ute...

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.280
Are you okay, Ute?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:02.980
Ute!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:08.080
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.150
My turn!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.120
I activate Continuous Spell 
Parasite Factory's effect

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:17.330
to equip a Fusion Parasite in 
my deck to Parasite Queen

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:19.200
and take control of it.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.680
The addition of another Fusion Parasite

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.570
increases Queen's attack 
points by another 300!

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.690
3000 attack points?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.980
I'll need Action Cards to dodge this.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.280
I won't let that happen.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.080
That's...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:53.360
My bug made it into Yuya Sakaki's head.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.970
Good... Good...

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:02.060
Now, Yuya Sakaki will become 
another of my servants.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:07.510
Swear fealty to me!

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.920
It seems you're one of us now, too.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.460
Who are you calling

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.900
one of you?

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:33.300
Why?

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.510
Why wasn't he brainwashed? Why?

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:43.290
Battle.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.600
I attack Dark Rebellion with Parasite Queen!

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:51.600
Trap card The Phantom Knights 
of Wrong Magnetring!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.940
By discarding a card with the same 
name as one in my graveyard,

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.080
I can negate this battle!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.300
Then, Wrong Magnetring becomes an Effect Monster

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.500
and is Special Summoned in attack position.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:07.970
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.880
My turn!

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.050
I activate my spell card Ancient Gear Inspection.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.260
I can activate one Ancient Gear monster 
on the field by returning it to my hand.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.940
It lets me draw one card.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.300
I'd like my Ancient Gear Hydra, if you please.

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:40.510
Draw!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.450
The loss of Ancient Gear Hydra

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.350
restores Chimera's attack points to normal.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.210
But it still has 2800 attack points!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.920
And I still have more life than you!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.590
I activate my spell card Polymerization.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:01.470
I send Ancient Gear Golem, 
Ancient Gear Gadget,

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:07.270
and Ancient Gear Wyvern from my hand 
to my graveyard, to Fusion Summon!

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:13.290
Appear, Level 10 Ultimate Ancient Gear Golem!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.410
Battle.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:22.250
I attack Frightfur Chimera with 
Ultimate Ancient Gear Golem!

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:39.660
All done.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.100
Hold it!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.450
Are you okay, Yuya?

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.440
Ute!

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.370
Yeah.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.480
My turn!

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.920
I activate The Phantom Knights 
of Wrong Magnetring's effect

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:08.180
to equip all Fusion Parasites 
on the field to it!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:15.200
And by tributing Wrong Magnetring with 
four Fusion Parasites equipped,

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.840
I can draw two cards!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:21.840
In that instant, Parasite Queen's 
attack points go down by 1200!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.680
Eliminating four Fusion Parasites at once...

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:31.020
I didn't think it was possible.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:35.320
And I activate my spell card Odd-Eyes Accel.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:41.830
It lets me summon Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon without tribute!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.830
So he has both of his ace monsters out...

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:53.100
But my Parasite deck still 
has more to show, too.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.280
I activate my trap Parasite Spell!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:15:00.080
When I have a Parasite monster on my field,

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.260
I can activate one spell card from a graveyard.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:07.550
I activate Parasite Discharge 
from Ruri's graveyard!

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:11.220
I Special Summon Fusion Parasite from my deck!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.940
I activate my Continuous Trap 
Parasite Generator!

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:17.730
When a Parasite monster is Special Summoned,

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:21.700
I can summon a Fusion Parasite from my deck.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:25.670
I also Special Summon as many Fusion Parasites

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:28.410
from both our graveyards as my field can hold!

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:35.080
In that instant, each Fusion 
Parasite counts as two,

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.280
and Parasite monsters cannot 
be destroyed by effects!

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.920
Additionally, for each Fusion Parasite,

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:47.730
Parasite Queen's effect increases 
its attack points by 300!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.700
5400 attack points...

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:55.310
You worked so hard to clear out 
our Fusion Parasites last turn,

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.670
but I guess it was pointless.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.160
You see that?

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.370
The true terror of the Parasite deck.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.670
He's...

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.840
Are you the Doctor?

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.440
I certainly am!

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.320
I am the Doctor, Yuya Sakaki.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.780
Where is Yuzu?!

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.730
Sorry, but you won't be able to see her...

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:22.760
Because you're going to die where you stand.

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:25.700
Of course, even if you saw her,

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:31.220
she is a prisoner of my bugs.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:47.610
What? What's going on?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:51.720
The Fusion Parasites... They're afraid?

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.790
No matter how many you send against me,

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.170
bugs are still bugs!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.840
Spell card The Phantom Knights' Possession!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:11.810
I grant an Xyz Monster the level of one 
monster on my side of the field.

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:17.480
I attribute Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon's Level 7

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:19.260
to Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:28.730
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.930
Dragon with different-colored eyes...

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.370
Be reborn from deepest darkness,

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.870
and scorch the whole world 
with your flames of anger!

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:41.610
Xyz Summon!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:47.610
Come out, dragon of fire who calls disaster,

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.390
Rank 7 Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.080
Odd-Eyes...

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.100
...Raging Dragon?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.880
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon's effect!

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:03.890
I use all of its Overlay Units to 
destroy all cards except for it.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:08.630
And for each card I destroy, 
its attack points increase by 200!

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:14.570
The fool. Has he forgotten?

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:19.680
Parasite Generator's effect prevents Parasite 
monsters' destruction by effects!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:25.150
And Parasite Factory's effect gives Parasite 
Queen a second level of protection!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.210
When this happens,

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:30.120
the effects of all spell and 
trap cards on the field

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.320
are negated!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.740
What?

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:34.790
That's awful.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.140
I've destroyed nine cards.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.990
As a result, Odd-Eyes Raging 
Dragon's attack points

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:53.370
increase by 1800.

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.050
N-No...

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:59.020
Battle.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.140
But there are two of us.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:06.140
Even if you defeat one of us, 
on the next turn, the other—

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.460
You won't get a next turn!

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:13.900
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon can 
attack twice on one turn.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:28.650
Odd-Eyes Raging Dragon attacks you directly!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.280
Furious Destruction Burst!

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.850
Serena! Are you okay?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.940
Where's the Doctor?

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.060
Ruri, speak to me.

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:16.290
Ruri...

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.760
Kurosaki! You're awake?

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:25.030
Wait, Serena! Ruri!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:27.610
Kurosaki...

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.160
Don't worry about me.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.580
Go after those two.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.160
The Professor will see you.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.900
Please come with us.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.470
Yuya!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:57.940
Wait!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.210
Well, well...

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:05.770
Welcome, Yuya Sakaki.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:09.150
I am Academia's genius scientist,

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.850
the Doctor.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.120
Yuzu!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.280
Damn!

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.990
Yuzu, are you okay?

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:22.690
What do you think of my special insect cage?

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.500
Yuzu, it's me! It's Yuya!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:26.660
Don't you recognize me?!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:30.740
Like I said, she is a prisoner of my bugs.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:37.580
As you can see, I have 
Yuya Sakaki in custody.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.550
Stay where you are, for a while...

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.620
W-Wait, Doctor!

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:46.750
Wait, Yuzu... Don't go!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.860
Yuzu!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:56.130
We've brought them, Professor.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.860
Good. Step back.

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.720
I have been waiting...

00:22:02.850 --> 00:22:04.810
Yusyo Sakaki.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:10.940
Dad!

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:51.000
Have you ever wondered

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:55.210
why summoning methods differ in 
each of the four dimensions?

00:23:55.750 --> 00:24:00.490
There used to be one world, 
in which they all existed.

00:24:00.490 --> 00:24:02.620
One world?

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:06.010
I dreamed of achieving fame there...

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:10.380
Without realizing I had opened Pandora's box.

00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:15.570
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Day the Devil Was Born.

00:24:15.570 --> 00:24:17.400
The fun is only getting started!
